{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival is a creative base-building and exploration survival game in a natural world, without zombies or monsters in the main game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on building, crafting, discovery and relaxed survival at your own pace. PvP is possible, but optional and not the main focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own survival: There are no fixed quests, you set your own goals, explore the island, build your base and freely develop your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An island with secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A worldwide pandemic has shaken humanity. On this remote island, there was once a secret research facility meant to develop a cure, but something went wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the global chaos, an evacuation flight was launched, but navigation data was unreliable, communication systems failed and fuel was running low.<br>The plane lost control and crashed near an unknown island, by accident\u2026 or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survive the crash and find yourself alone in a seemingly peaceful but abandoned world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the island, you discover voice messages from a woman named Jill, who was here before you. She reports strange events, experiments in the research facility and something hidden deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the facility, you come across traces of these experiments\u2026 remnants of something human, that is no longer entirely human.<br>The research created something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jill\u2019s last message ends with a warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI can\u2019t receive any signals worldwide anymore \u2013 except for one last weak transmission from New York. Stay on the island\u2026 this could be the last safe place.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island tells only part of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you go, the greater the mystery of the world becomes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building &amp; Designing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases from wood, stone, glass, straw and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build workbenches, furniture and functional structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own settlements and creative projects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process materials, smelt metals and expand your infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate electricity with solar and wind power</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nature &amp; Self-Sufficiency</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own garden (e.g. vegetables, potatoes, plants)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process resources through cooking and smelting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame dogs as loyal hunting companions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world with abandoned buildings and secret locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles, horses and boats for transportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather &amp; day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues to the true story of the island</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst and exhaustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting and defense against wild animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No zombies or monsters in the main game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP possible, but voluntary and not the focus</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer &amp; Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in co-op with friends (P2P)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional PvP</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional DLC: For players seeking more challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game offers a realistic, nature-based survival experience <strong>without zombies or monsters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who want to experience an alternative, more dangerous version of the world, there is a <strong>free, optional DLC</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This alternative game mode poses the question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What would have happened if the experiments at the research facility had never been stopped?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures, increased danger and new survival strategies await you, completely optional and separate from the main focus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival offers you an open world without a fixed ending; you decide how you survive, build, explore and uncover the island\u2019s secrets.</strong><br>Every decision shapes your own story.<br>Whether you want to build creatively, live peacefully or explore the island\u2019s lore, <strong>you decide where your journey leads.</strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"COLLECT WOODS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/ee3609afb0aa29d54e05df2dfa3b7325850fee0a.jpg"},{"name":"COLLECT STONES","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/9d942b6dcc808036ec3ff9cc43d8333e2fc1dc16.jpg"},{"name":"COLLECT RUBBISH","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/8e6eb37ce96ef339a7ac29c2d2e978d076cf06d5.jpg"},{"name":"CREATE A HAMMER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/09c4dc5774fc64a5d6cacffae022da122aa9aae0.jpg"},{"name":"FIND NAILS","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/8c3c47c026e064439ff0c269eeea833f95e82d43.jpg"},{"name":"USE LADDER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/a64573ecef76cd9b378e705144efd6471fab487e.jpg"},{"name":"CREATE A AXT","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/55d7fa9fa5109aefd1adcb31df75e9cf8384c5fb.jpg"},{"name":"CREATE A SHOVEL","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/9d3ce6586344aa6db2e2834a054693505ad544b7.jpg"},{"name":"PLAY GUITAR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/0133937f70a6407fcb5a847927375e13102f8c02.jpg"},{"name":"LAGERFEUER","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1524630/69468e94d510c45f46b23ff649e994e5054fd5e7.jpg"}],"total":32},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1524630?t=1762523971","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762523971","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762523971","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1524630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762523971","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains content about violence and blood that may not be suitable for all audiences and not all age groups. Blood is shown when killing an animal or character."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival is a creative base-building and exploration survival game in a natural world, without zombies or monsters in the main game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on building, crafting, discovery and relaxed survival at your own pace. PvP is possible, but optional and not the main focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your own survival: There are no fixed quests, you set your own goals, explore the island, build your base and freely develop your playstyle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An island with secrets</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A worldwide pandemic has shaken humanity. On this remote island, there was once a secret research facility meant to develop a cure, but something went wrong.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the global chaos, an evacuation flight was launched, but navigation data was unreliable, communication systems failed and fuel was running low.<br>The plane lost control and crashed near an unknown island, by accident\u2026 or maybe not?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You survive the crash and find yourself alone in a seemingly peaceful but abandoned world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the island, you discover voice messages from a woman named Jill, who was here before you. She reports strange events, experiments in the research facility and something hidden deep beneath the surface.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inside the facility, you come across traces of these experiments\u2026 remnants of something human, that is no longer entirely human.<br>The research created something that should never have existed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Jill\u2019s last message ends with a warning:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cI can\u2019t receive any signals worldwide anymore \u2013 except for one last weak transmission from New York. Stay on the island\u2026 this could be the last safe place.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island tells only part of the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The deeper you go, the greater the mystery of the world becomes.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Building &amp; Designing</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build bases from wood, stone, glass, straw and much more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build workbenches, furniture and functional structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own settlements and creative projects</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Crafting &amp; Progression</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft tools, weapons and equipment</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process materials, smelt metals and expand your infrastructure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Generate electricity with solar and wind power</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Nature &amp; Self-Sufficiency</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grow your own garden (e.g. vegetables, potatoes, plants)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Process resources through cooking and smelting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tame dogs as loyal hunting companions</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Exploration &amp; Atmosphere</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open world with abandoned buildings and secret locations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vehicles, horses and boats for transportation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather &amp; day-night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover clues to the true story of the island</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survival Elements</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunger, thirst and exhaustion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hunting and defense against wild animals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No zombies or monsters in the main game</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PvP possible, but voluntary and not the focus</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Multiplayer &amp; Customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or in co-op with friends (P2P)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional PvP</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Optional DLC: For players seeking more challenge</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main game offers a realistic, nature-based survival experience <strong>without zombies or monsters</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For players who want to experience an alternative, more dangerous version of the world, there is a <strong>free, optional DLC</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This alternative game mode poses the question:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What would have happened if the experiments at the research facility had never been stopped?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mutated creatures, increased danger and new survival strategies await you, completely optional and separate from the main focus.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Conclusion</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KeepUp Survival offers you an open world without a fixed ending; you decide how you survive, build, explore and uncover the island\u2019s secrets.</strong><br>Every decision shapes your own story.<br>Whether you want to build creatively, live peacefully or explore the island\u2019s lore, <strong>you decide where your journey leads.</strong></p>","developers":["Witte Studio"],"dlc":[2841550,1955090,1988040,2096140,4046130],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation